# Line endings
# -------------
# Every text file is stored in the repository with LF endings and checked out
# with LF on every platform. `eol=lf` is set explicitly rather than left to
# `core.eol=native` so that a Windows working tree is byte-identical to a Linux
# or macOS one, and `git status` never reports whole-file line-ending churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
# -------------
# Excluded from line-ending conversion and from textual diffing.
*.webp  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
